       <div class=\\\"ffu-service-icon\\\">\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"6\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"2\\\"/></svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"ffu-service-title\\\">TIRE MANAGEMENT</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"ffu-service-description\\\">Fleet tire programs including rotation, balancing, and replacement coordination.</p>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n<!-- /wp:html -->\\n\\n</div>\\n<!-- /wp:group -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"ffu-section\\\",\\\"layout\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"constrained\\\",\\\"contentSize\\\":\\\"1400px\\\"}} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group ffu-section\\\">\\n\\n<!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"ffu-section-header\\\",\\\"layout\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"default\\\"}} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group ffu-section-header\\\">\\n\\n<!-- wp:html -->\\n<div class=\\\"ffu-section-label\\\">WHY CHOOSE US</div>\\n<!-- /wp:html -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:heading {\\\"textAlign\\\":\\\"center\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"ffu-section-title\\\"} -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center ffu-section-title\\\">FLEET PARTNERSHIP BENEFITS</h2>\\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\\n\\n</div>\\n<!-- /wp:group -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:html -->\\n<div class=\\\"ffu-benefits-grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"ffu-benefit-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ffu-benefit-icon\\\">\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\"/><path d=\\\"M12 6v6l4 2\\\"/></svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"ffu-benefit-title\\\">MINIMIZE DOWNTIME</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"ffu-benefit-description\\\">On-site service means your vehicles spend less time out of commission. We work around your schedule.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"ffu-benefit-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ffu-benefit-icon\\\">\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\\\"/></svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"ffu-benefit-title\\\">COST PREDICTABILITY</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"ffu-benefit-description\\\">Scheduled maintenance programs help you budget for fleet expenses and avoid costly emergency repairs.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"ffu-benefit-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ffu-benefit-icon\\\">\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"><path d=\\\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\\\"/><polyline points=\\\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\\\"/></svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"ffu-benefit-title\\\">PRIORITY SERVICE</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"ffu-benefit-description\\\">Fleet customers receive priority scheduling and faster response times for urgent repairs.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"ffu-benefit-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ffu-benefit-icon\\\">\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"><path d=\\\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\\\"/><polyline points=\\\"14 2 14 8 20 8\\\"/></svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"ffu-benefit-title\\\">DETAILED RECORDS</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"ffu-benefit-description\\\">Complete maintenance history for every vehicle in your fleet, accessible anytime.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"ffu-benefit-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ffu-benefit-icon\\\">\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\\\"/></svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"ffu-benefit-title\\\">CERTIFIED TECHNICIANS</h3>\\n        <p class=\\