INSERT INTO `cms_search_index` VALUES
(1,'page',1,'Home','home','','Home Serving Your Area WE FIX ITFOR YOU Professional automotive repair services for every vehicle in your life. From mobile car repair to heavy-duty machinery — we\'ve got you covered. Explore Services Get a Quote Scroll OUR SERVICES COMPLETE AUTOMOTIVEREPAIR SOLUTIONS Mobile Service CARS & LIGHT VEHICLES We bring the shop to you. Our mobile mechanics service cars, light trucks, SUVs, and passenger vehicles at your home or workplace. Mobile Mechanic On-Site Repair Diagnostics Learn More MARINE REPAIR Comprehensive marine engine repair and maintenance. Keep your boat running smooth with our expert technicians. Inboard/Outboard Engine Repair Winterization Learn More RV & MOTOR HOME Full-service RV and motor home repair. From engine work to living systems, we keep your home on wheels road-ready. Engine Service Generator Systems Learn More FLEET SERVICES Dedicated fleet management and repair solutions. Minimize downtime and maximize efficiency for your business vehicles. Maintenance Plans Priority Service Reporting Learn More HEAVY DUTY Expert repair services for semi-trucks, commercial vehicles, and heavy equipment. Keeping your workhorses working. Diesel Engines Transmission DOT Inspection Learn More READY TO GET STARTED? Contact us today for a free estimate. We\'re here to help keep you moving. (555) 123-4567 Email Us Service Area: Metro & Surrounding Hours: Mon–Sat 7AM–6PM','draft','2026-02-28 14:03:40'),
(2,'page',2,'RV Repair','rv-repair','','RV Repair RV Services RV & MOTOR HOME REPAIR & MAINTENANCE Professional RV and motor home repair services. Mobile mechanics specializing in recreational vehicle maintenance, repairs, and pre-trip inspections. Get ready for your next adventure. Mobile Service All RV Types Pre-Trip Inspections Get Free Quote → ߓ 616-409-8940 AllRV Types MobileService 24 MoWarranty OUR SERVICES RV MAINTENANCE & REPAIR Comprehensive RV services to keep your recreational vehicle road-ready. ENGINE SERVICE Complete engine diagnostics, maintenance, and repair for gas and diesel RV engines. PRE-TRIP INSPECTIONS Comprehensive safety inspections before your trip to ensure worry-free travel. BRAKE SERVICE Brake inspection, pad replacement, and complete brake system repairs. ELECTRICAL SYSTEMS 12V and 120V electrical system diagnostics, wiring, and component repair. HVAC & A/C Air conditioning, heating, and ventilation system service and repair. SUSPENSION Leveling systems, air suspension, shocks, and chassis component service. RV TYPES WE SERVICE ALL RECREATIONAL VEHICLES CLASS A MOTORHOMES Full-size diesel and gas motorhomes from all major manufacturers. CLASS B CAMPERVANS Campervans and converted vans built on standard van chassis. CLASS C MOTORHOMES Mid-size motorhomes with cab-over designs on truck chassis. TRAVEL TRAILERS Towable travel trailers of all sizes, from small to large fifth wheels. FIFTH WHEELS Large fifth-wheel trailers with hitch-in-bed towing configuration. TOY HAULERS Motorhomes and trailers with garage space for ATVs and motorcycles. READY FOR ADVENTURE Travel with confidence knowing your RV has been serviced by certified professionals. 24 MONTH24,000 MILE WARRANTY READY FOR YOUR NEXT TRIP? Schedule your RV service or pre-trip inspection today. 616-409-8940 Get Free Quote Email Us','draft','2026-03-02 04:58:34'),
(3,'page',3,'Heavy Duty Repair','heavy-duty-repair','','Heavy Duty Repair Heavy Duty HEAVY DUTY TRUCK & EQUIPMENT REPAIR Professional heavy duty truck and equipment repair services. Diesel engine specialists serving commercial trucks, construction equipment, and industrial vehicles throughout West Michigan. Diesel Specialists On-Site Service DOT Inspections Get Free Quote → ߓ 616-409-8940 Class 8Certified DOTInspections 24/7Emergency OUR SERVICES HEAVY DUTY REPAIR SERVICES Expert diesel and heavy equipment repair services for commercial and industrial vehicles. DIESEL ENGINE REPAIR Complete diesel engine diagnostics, repair, and rebuilds for all major manufacturers. TRANSMISSION SERVICE Heavy duty transmission repair and service for manual and automatic systems. BRAKE & AIR SYSTEMS Air brake service, compressor repair, and complete brake system overhauls. ELECTRICAL SYSTEMS Heavy duty electrical diagnostics, wiring repair, and component replacement. DOT INSPECTIONS Complete DOT safety inspections and compliance services to keep you on the road. HYDRAULIC SYSTEMS Hydraulic pump, cylinder, and hose repair for trucks and construction equipment. EQUIPMENT WE SERVICE COMMERCIAL & INDUSTRIAL VEHICLES SEMI TRUCKS Class 7 and Class 8 semi-trucks and tractors from all major manufacturers. CONSTRUCTION EQUIPMENT Excavators, loaders, dozers, and other heavy construction machinery. BOX TRUCKS & VANS Delivery trucks, box trucks, and commercial vans of all sizes. AGRICULTURAL EQUIPMENT Tractors, combines, and farm equipment diesel engine service. TRAILERS Trailer brake service, lighting, and suspension repairs. BUSES School buses, coach buses, and transit vehicle maintenance and repair. NEED HEAVY DUTY REPAIRS? Get your equipment back in service with our expert technicians. 616-409-8940 Get Free Quote Email Us','published','2026-03-02 04:59:21'),
(4,'page',4,'Fleet','fleet','','Fleet Fleet Services FLEET MAINTENANCE & REPAIR Keep your business moving with professional fleet maintenance solutions. Our mobile technicians minimize downtime by servicing your vehicles on-site, on your schedule. On-Site Service Priority Scheduling Detailed Records Request Consultation → ߓ 616-409-8940 50+Fleet Clients 24hrResponse 98%Uptime OUR SERVICES FLEET MAINTENANCE & REPAIR Comprehensive fleet solutions designed to keep your vehicles on the road and your business running. SCHEDULED MAINTENANCE Preventive maintenance programs tailored to your fleet\'s needs. Oil changes, inspections, and tune-ups on your schedule. ON-SITE REPAIRS Our mobile technicians come to your location to minimize vehicle downtime and keep your operations moving. BRAKE SERVICE Complete brake system service including pads, rotors, and hydraulic repairs for safe fleet operations. ENGINE DIAGNOSTICS Advanced diagnostic equipment to quickly identify and resolve engine issues across your fleet. ELECTRICAL SYSTEMS Battery testing, alternator service, starter repairs, and complete electrical system diagnostics. TIRE MANAGEMENT Fleet tire programs including rotation, balancing, and replacement coordination. WHY CHOOSE US FLEET PARTNERSHIP BENEFITS MINIMIZE DOWNTIME On-site service means your vehicles spend less time out of commission. We work around your schedule. COST PREDICTABILITY Scheduled maintenance programs help you budget for fleet expenses and avoid costly emergency repairs. PRIORITY SERVICE Fleet customers receive priority scheduling and faster response times for urgent repairs. DETAILED RECORDS Complete maintenance history for every vehicle in your fleet, accessible anytime. CERTIFIED TECHNICIANS All work performed by certified professionals with commercial vehicle experience. DEDICATED SUPPORT A dedicated account manager to coordinate all your fleet service needs. READY TO OPTIMIZE YOUR FLEET? Contact us today for a customized fleet maintenance program. ߓ 616-409-8940 Email Us','draft','2026-03-02 05:00:00'),
(5,'page',5,'Vehicle Repair','vehicle-repair','','Vehicle Repair Mobile Service AUTO REPAIR AT YOUR LOCATION Convenient auto repair services done at your home or office. Our certified technicians bring expertise and quality to repairs throughout West Michigan—no matter the year, make, or model. No Transport Needed All Makes & Models Free Quotes 24/7 Get Free Quote 616-409-8940 24/7Quotes AllVehicles 24 MoWarranty HOW IT WORKS WE MAKE AUTO REPAIR EASY No need to transport your vehicle. No need to wait at a shop. Our service comes to you. 1 GET YOUR FREE QUOTE Tell us what\'s wrong and we\'ll send you a free detailed repair quote, usually within minutes. No obligation. 2 SELECT YOUR DATE Pick time slots that work for you easily online. We\'ll confirm appointments and send reminders. 3 BETTER REPAIR EXPERIENCE Our technicians bring everything needed to you. Work from home while we handle your repair. WHY CHOOSE US CERTIFIED EXPERTS AT YOUR SERVICE Our technicians are passionate problem-solvers dedicated to getting your vehicle back on the road. CERTIFIED PROFESSIONALS Our auto repair technicians are certified professionals with years of hands-on repair and diagnostic experience. ALL VEHICLES WELCOME Regardless of your vehicle\'s year, make, or model, our certified technicians possess the expertise to provide top-notch care. EXTENSIVE EXPERTISE From minor fixes to complex repairs, our technicians have the skills to address all your automotive needs comprehensively. UNCOMPROMISED QUALITY We are committed to delivering exceptional service. Our warranty is a testament to the confidence we have in our work. FLEET & DEALERSHIP Our expertise extends beyond individual vehicles—we cater to fleets and dealerships with tailored solutions. QUOTES ANYTIME Say goodbye to lengthy waiting times. Our online platform allows you to receive a free quote usually within minutes, 24/7. OUR SERVICES DOZENS OF SERVICES AT YOUR LOCATION Professional auto repair services available at your home or office. VEHICLE MAINTENANCE Schedule routine maintenance such as oil changes, fluid changes, and filter replacements. SYSTEM DIAGNOSIS & REPAIR Diagnostic services for every system and component in your vehicle. BRAKE REPAIR Quality brake pad and rotor options that meet or exceed OE specifications. AIR CONDITIONING Keep your vehicle\'s A/C working properly with expert service and repairs. SHOCKS & STRUTS Shocks, struts, and suspension component replacement designed for your car or truck. KEY & MODULE PROGRAMMING Programming keys, fobs, and modules for modern vehicles. View All Services UNCOMPROMISED QUALITY We stand behind our work with confidence. Every repair backed by our comprehensive warranty. 24 MONTH24,000 MILE WARRANTY SERVICE AREA SERVING WEST MICHIGAN Mobile auto repair throughout the greater Grand Rapids area. Primary Service Area Grand Rapids Comstock Park East Grand Rapids Grandville Kentwood Walker Wyoming Secondary Service Area Belding Greenville Ionia Surrounding Areas READY TO GET STARTED? Get your free quote today or call us directly 616-409-8940 Get Free Quote Email Us','draft','2026-03-02 05:01:25'),
(6,'page',6,'Marine Repair','marine','','Marine Repair FIXITFOR.US Services About Contact Call Now Marine Specialists MARINE REPAIR SERVICES Keep your boat running smooth with our expert marine engine repair and maintenance. From inboard to outboard motors, we service all types of marine vessels. Inboard & Outboard Winterization Certified Technicians Get Free Estimate (555) 123-4567 200+ Boats Serviced 15+ Years Exp All Brands OUR SERVICES MARINE REPAIR SERVICES Comprehensive boat engine and systems repair to keep you on the water. ENGINE REPAIR Complete inboard and outboard engine diagnostics, repair, and rebuilds. TUNE-UPS Regular maintenance including oil changes, spark plugs, and fuel system service. ELECTRICAL SYSTEMS Marine electrical diagnostics, wiring repairs, and battery service. LOWER UNIT SERVICE Gear oil changes, seal replacements, and prop repairs. COOLING SYSTEMS Water pump replacement, impeller service, and thermostat repairs. WINTERIZATION Complete winterization services to protect your boat during off-season storage. READY TO GET YOUR BOAT SERVICED? Contact us today for a free estimate on your marine repair needs. (555) 123-4567 Email Us','draft','2026-03-07 23:26:52');
